        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions FII-FRP15 1-1/2\" Contemporary Round  Shower Door Finger Pulls</b>\r\n<p>\r\nRecessed 1-1/2\" round flush glass shower pulls. They are mounted back to back (screw together) on 3/8\"  - 1/2\" inch thick glass sliding shower doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Impeccably machined from high quality aluminum with a satin aluminum finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe below pictures show the Round  Shower Door Finger Pulls installed and a side view.\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FRP15-details.jpg?v=1704442266\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Round  Shower Door Finger Pull Details\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of  FII-FRP15 1-1/2\" Contemporary Round  Shower Door Finger Pulls\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Outside Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Inside Diameter (finger opening): 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Glass Mounting Hole Diameter: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Aluminum</b></li>\r\n<li>Glass Thickness: Adjustable for 3/8\" - 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Note:</b> These do NOT fit a standard 1/2\" diameter hole in a glass door. <br>\r\n<b>Fits a Hole Diameter of 1-1/8\"</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold as a pair. </b> One male threaded pull and one female threaded pull.\r\n</p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<p><b>**Item Discontinued</b> Use <a href=\"/products/low-profile-sliding-glass-door-finger-pull-rks-1s\"><b>SGS-RKS-1 Low Profile Sliding Glass Door Finger Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<br>",
